  "@type": "sc:Dataset",
  "name": "argus-uq",
  "description": "Argus-UQ benchmark - per-item uncertainty quantification scores for vision-language-model GUI grounding agents across 28 cells (16 open-weight + 12 closed-API). Each cell contains 27 (open-source) or 8 (closed-source) UQ method scores per item, plus correctness labels and distance to the gold target.",
